{"id":"cue-0-0","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":0,"source_end_seconds":3.74,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.74,"text":"誰能告訴告訴我這磨出來這個薑末到底能幹啥呀"}
{"id":"cue-1-3740","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":3.74,"source_end_seconds":6.9,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.16,"text":"蒜末我還是能理解的啊我們東北用的戰餃子"}
{"id":"cue-2-6900","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-0-0","source_start_seconds":6.9,"source_end_seconds":9.26,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.36,"text":"但是他們總宣傳著還能磨薑末"}
{"id":"cue-3-9260","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-3-9260","source_start_seconds":9.26,"source_end_seconds":11.58,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.32,"text":"關鍵是還沒有幾個好使的"}
{"id":"cue-4-11580","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-3-9260","source_start_seconds":11.58,"source_end_seconds":13.64,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.06,"text":"也不知道這薑末到底能幹啥"}
{"id":"cue-5-13640","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-3-9260","source_start_seconds":13.64,"source_end_seconds":16.56,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.92,"text":"還在這樣度薑末嗎聰明人都在用模擬器啦"}
{"id":"cue-6-16560","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-3-9260","source_start_seconds":16.56,"source_end_seconds":17.98,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.42,"text":"模擬輕鬆不傷手"}
{"id":"cue-7-20280","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-7-20280","source_start_seconds":20.28,"source_end_seconds":22.18,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.9,"text":"磨出來的泥細膩無渣"}
{"id":"cue-8-22180","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-7-20280","source_start_seconds":22.18,"source_end_seconds":24.76,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.58,"text":"研磨蒜泥還能做成醬料碟用"}
{"id":"cue-9-24760","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-24760","source_start_seconds":24.76,"source_end_seconds":26.72,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.96,"text":"家裡的果疏隨磨隨用"}
{"id":"cue-10-26720","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-24760","source_start_seconds":26.72,"source_end_seconds":28.82,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.1,"text":"大概冷藏保鮮不創味"}
{"id":"cue-11-28820","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-24760","source_start_seconds":28.82,"source_end_seconds":30.52,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"視頻存款咱也買回來了"}
{"id":"cue-12-30520","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-24760","source_start_seconds":30.52,"source_end_seconds":31.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.36,"text":"咱們的效果到底怎麼樣"}
{"id":"cue-13-31880","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-24760","source_start_seconds":31.88,"source_end_seconds":33.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.46,"text":"誇獎的坑還是我們來菜"}
{"id":"cue-14-33340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-9-24760","source_start_seconds":33.34,"source_end_seconds":35.54,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.2,"text":"也費的散河關注麻煩您給支持一個"}
{"id":"cue-15-35540","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-15-35540","source_start_seconds":35.54,"source_end_seconds":37.82,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.28,"text":"這研磨器咱們真是測過好多款"}
{"id":"cue-16-37820","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-15-35540","source_start_seconds":37.82,"source_end_seconds":39.42,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"多數都是智商稅"}
{"id":"cue-17-39420","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-15-35540","source_start_seconds":39.42,"source_end_seconds":44.56,"speaking_duration_seconds":5.14,"text":"我是真想不明白究竟是哪個地區的人需要磨這個薑個蒜呢"}
{"id":"cue-18-44560","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-15-35540","source_start_seconds":44.56,"source_end_seconds":46.48,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.92,"text":"我們東北都是用蒜缸的"}
{"id":"cue-19-46480","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-15-35540","source_start_seconds":46.48,"source_end_seconds":48.18,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"然後用桿不讓搭檔檔檔的"}
{"id":"cue-20-48180","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-15-35540","source_start_seconds":48.18,"source_end_seconds":49.88,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"對哦來咱們看看這款"}
{"id":"cue-21-51240","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-21-51240","source_start_seconds":51.24,"source_end_seconds":54.1,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.86,"text":"你看看這快遞來了乾巴的就動個東西"}
{"id":"cue-22-54100","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-21-51240","source_start_seconds":54.1,"source_end_seconds":56.44,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.34,"text":"廠牆心意知識妖準喝個啥啥沒有"}
{"id":"cue-23-56440","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-21-51240","source_start_seconds":56.44,"source_end_seconds":58.14,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.7,"text":"這不又是個三不成品嗎"}
{"id":"cue-24-59160","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-24-59160","source_start_seconds":59.16,"source_end_seconds":60.92,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.76,"text":"打開之後就是這樣試的"}
{"id":"cue-25-60920","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-24-59160","source_start_seconds":60.92,"source_end_seconds":63.86,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.94,"text":"能聞著有一股輕微的略知塑料味"}
{"id":"cue-26-63860","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-24-59160","source_start_seconds":63.86,"source_end_seconds":65.46,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.6,"text":"這個結構也是比較簡單"}
{"id":"cue-27-65460","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-24-59160","source_start_seconds":65.46,"source_end_seconds":69.18,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.72,"text":"看看這個上面都是帶一排排小塑料牙齒的"}
{"id":"cue-28-69180","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-69180","source_start_seconds":69.18,"source_end_seconds":70.38,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.2,"text":"磨完之後呢"}
{"id":"cue-29-70380","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-69180","source_start_seconds":70.38,"source_end_seconds":72.74,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.36,"text":"薑磨和蒜磨就跑底這個河裏了"}
{"id":"cue-30-72740","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-69180","source_start_seconds":72.74,"source_end_seconds":74.16,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.42,"text":"那薑咱們也準備好了"}
{"id":"cue-31-74160","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-28-69180","source_start_seconds":74.16,"source_end_seconds":75.66,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.5,"text":"來直接試試"}
{"id":"cue-32-78600","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-32-78600","source_start_seconds":78.6,"source_end_seconds":81.82,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.22,"text":"你別說這東西有效果"}
{"id":"cue-33-81820","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-32-78600","source_start_seconds":81.82,"source_end_seconds":83.38,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.56,"text":"你斜著打開"}
{"id":"cue-34-89450","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-89450","source_start_seconds":89.45,"source_end_seconds":92.21,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.76,"text":"真的有效果挺不容易測這麼多"}
{"id":"cue-35-92210","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-34-89450","source_start_seconds":92.21,"source_end_seconds":94.05,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.84,"text":"終於測這個有點效果來了"}
{"id":"cue-36-94930","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-36-94930","source_start_seconds":94.93,"source_end_seconds":95.97,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.04,"text":"來打開看看"}
{"id":"cue-37-98030","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-37-98030","source_start_seconds":98.03,"source_end_seconds":100.19,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.16,"text":"看看這薑咱們沒削皮沒洗"}
{"id":"cue-38-100190","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-37-98030","source_start_seconds":100.19,"source_end_seconds":103.19,"speaking_duration_seconds":3,"text":"實際上磨的確實挺好挺細膩"}
{"id":"cue-39-103190","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-37-98030","source_start_seconds":103.19,"source_end_seconds":105.11,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.92,"text":"咱們再磨兩邊蒜試一試"}
{"id":"cue-40-108920","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-108920","source_start_seconds":108.92,"source_end_seconds":112.34,"speaking_duration_seconds":3.42,"text":"你別說磨這個蒜也挺好使的"}
{"id":"cue-41-112340","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-40-108920","source_start_seconds":112.34,"source_end_seconds":114.16,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.82,"text":"但是剩個根的時候"}
{"id":"cue-42-114160","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-42-114160","source_start_seconds":114.16,"source_end_seconds":115.46,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.3,"text":"這個手就掐不住了"}
{"id":"cue-43-115460","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-42-114160","source_start_seconds":115.46,"source_end_seconds":116.62,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.16,"text":"就容易磨到這個手"}
{"id":"cue-44-116620","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-42-114160","source_start_seconds":116.62,"source_end_seconds":117.74,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.12,"text":"確實是好使"}
{"id":"cue-45-117740","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-42-114160","source_start_seconds":117.74,"source_end_seconds":119.22,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.48,"text":"只是蒜太小了"}
{"id":"cue-46-119220","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-42-114160","source_start_seconds":119.22,"source_end_seconds":121.12,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.9,"text":"剩的少的時候容易磨手"}
{"id":"cue-47-121120","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-42-114160","source_start_seconds":121.12,"source_end_seconds":123.44,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.32,"text":"還是磨薑比較有效果"}
{"id":"cue-48-123440","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-123440","source_start_seconds":123.44,"source_end_seconds":125.18,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.74,"text":"我給大家打開看看這蒜"}
{"id":"cue-49-125180","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-123440","source_start_seconds":125.18,"source_end_seconds":127.56,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.38,"text":"看看磨的還是比較細膩的"}
{"id":"cue-50-127560","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-123440","source_start_seconds":127.56,"source_end_seconds":128.72,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.16,"text":"還有一個遺憾"}
{"id":"cue-51-128720","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-123440","source_start_seconds":128.72,"source_end_seconds":130.4,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.68,"text":"就是咱們不知道這是什麼材質的"}
{"id":"cue-52-130400","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-123440","source_start_seconds":130.4,"source_end_seconds":131.46,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.06,"text":"是個散工產品"}
{"id":"cue-53-131460","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-48-123440","source_start_seconds":131.46,"source_end_seconds":132.84,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.38,"text":"所以咱們就不能回見了"}
{"id":"cue-54-132840","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-54-132840","source_start_seconds":132.84,"source_end_seconds":135.1,"speaking_duration_seconds":2.26,"text":"要不然這小東西看起來真挺好"}
{"id":"cue-55-135100","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-54-132840","source_start_seconds":135.1,"source_end_seconds":136.42,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.32,"text":"如果有真正用得上的"}
{"id":"cue-56-136420","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-54-132840","source_start_seconds":136.42,"source_end_seconds":137.42,"speaking_duration_seconds":1,"text":"一定要問問它"}
{"id":"cue-57-137420","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-54-132840","source_start_seconds":137.42,"source_end_seconds":139.26,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.84,"text":"有沒有合格症是什麼材質的"}
{"id":"cue-58-139260","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-54-132840","source_start_seconds":139.26,"source_end_seconds":140.38,"speaking_duration_seconds":1.12,"text":"大家根據自己情況"}
{"id":"cue-59-140380","group_id":"source-speech-v1:cue-54-132840","source_start_seconds":140.38,"source_end_seconds":141.24,"speaking_duration_seconds":0.86,"text":"重新考慮吧"}
